{"type":"text","timestamp":1794276196532,"sessionID":"ses_e3cd18a48ffenKuVMJcQwTSrkz","part":{"id":"prt_1c3311b4a001QWPUAkd5Kkf6xw","sessionID":"ses_e3cd18a48ffenKuVMJcQwTSrkz","messageID":"msg_1c330fbe0001lQtANuymsF3PJ1","type":"text","text":"Let me analyze the issues more carefully. Looking at the failing tests, I can see:\n\n1. `to_cents(\"19.99\")` returns 1998 instead of 1999 (rounding issue)\n2. `net_cents()` returns 3000 instead of 2550 for a 10.00 * 3 line with 15% discount\n3. `tax_cents()` returns 399 instead of 400 due to rounding\n\nLet me now fix the implementation step by step according to the rules:\n\n1. Fix `to_cents` to properly round to nearest cent\n2. Fix the invoice logic to apply discounts before tax calculation\n3. Fix tax calculation to be rounded properly","time":{"start":1794276137802,"end":1794276196532}}}
