{"type":"text","timestamp":1794276666928,"sessionID":"ses_e3cd18a48ffenKuVMJcQwTSrkz","part":{"id":"prt_1c338c35d001G1GBeFZr2qKy81","sessionID":"ses_e3cd18a48ffenKuVMJcQwTSrkz","messageID":"msg_1c338bcc4001C3JmgrHOIJNi15","type":"text","text":"Perfect! The implementation is now correct:\n\n1. `to_cents(\"19.99\")` returns `1999` (proper rounding)\n2. For the 33% discount on a 50-cent line:\n   - Discount amount = 50 * 0.33 = 16.5\n   - Rounded half up = 17\n   - Net after discount = 50 - 17 = 33\n3. Tax is calculated on the discounted net amount properly\n\nLet me run the tests one more time to make sure everything is working:","time":{"start":1794276639581,"end":1794276666928}}}
